<!-- Button trigger modal -->
<span class="fa fa-info-circle help-icon" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#helpModal"></span>

<!-- Modal -->
<div class="modal fade" id="helpModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title" id="helpModalLabel">Help</h5>
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p><b>PRRPS Approvals</b> are the roles that the worker has been approved to work in. Only roles that require specific 
        approval are displayed. Some approval categories are for non&ndash;rail safety work, such as road vehicle operation.</p>
        <p>Approvals that have been withdrawn temporarily or permanently are not shown. Any restrictions on an approval (e.g. 
        due to health-triggered job modification) may appear in the "Other detail" column.</p>
        <p>Approvals are issued when all pre-requisites are met, including all required training, assessments, membership status
        and a rail safety health assessment if applicable. Prior to October/November 1999 approvals were determined by the Executive Committee. 
        At that time the Executive Committee made approvals the responsibility of superintendents.</p>
        
        <p><b>PRRPS Assessments</b> are workplace assessments or examinations conducted by or for PRRPS in accordance with a PRRPS 
        competency standard or examination paper (which may include recognition of prior learning).</p>
        <p>If a worker has been re-assessed then only the most recent record of that assessment type will be shown. Assessments that 
        were not satisfactorily completed (i.e. "Not yet competent") are not shown.</p>
        <p>Unlike approvals, assessments cannot be withdrawn (although they may have an expiry date) as they are simply a point-in-time 
        record that an assessment was conducted.</p>

        <p><b>External Training and Qualifications</b> lists the courses undertaken externally by the worker, and licences, 
        certifications and qualifications issued by external bodies.</p>
        <p>If a licence, certification or qualification has an expiry date it will not be displayed after expiration.</p>
        
        <p><b>Rail Safety Health Assessment</b> is a summary of the worker's most recent health assessment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
